{"id":"flat-material","title":"Flat Design — Material Era","description":"The 2013–2018 reaction to glossy Web 2.0 — flat colors, no gradients, an app bar with hamburger drawer, ripple buttons, cards, a floating action button and snackbars. Roboto-era minimalism.","tags":["flat","material","web-app"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:37:58.303Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Flat Design — Material Era\ndescription: The 2013–2018 reaction to glossy Web 2.0 — flat colors, no gradients, an app bar with hamburger drawer, ripple buttons, cards, a floating action button and snackbars. Roboto-era minimalism.\ntags: [flat, material, web-app]\norder: 13\n---\n\n# Flat Design — Material Era\n\nThe pendulum swing after Web 2.0: every gradient, bevel and gloss is stripped away. What\nremains is bold flat color, typography, elevation shadows and motion that responds to touch.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Primary | `#2196F3` blue (app bar), dark `#1976D2` |\n| Accent | `#FF4081` pink (FAB) |\n| Background | `#fafafa`, cards `#ffffff` |\n| Text | `#212121` primary · `#757575` secondary |\n| Elevation | soft card shadows `0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.26)` |\n| Type | \"Segoe UI\"/Roboto stack, 500-weight buttons in CAPS |\n\n## Pieces\n\nApp bar with **hamburger drawer** (slide-in + scrim) → flat hero with a pure-CSS phone\nmockup → 3 cards with **ripple-effect** buttons → floating action button that fires a\n**snackbar** toast — the full Material interaction set, zero dependencies.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Flat Design — Material Era\n\nThe pendulum swing after Web 2.0: every gradient, bevel and gloss is stripped away. What\nremains is bold flat color, typography, elevation shadows and motion that responds to touch.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Primary | `#2196F3` blue (app bar), dark `#1976D2` |\n| Accent | `#FF4081` pink (FAB) |\n| Background | `#fafafa`, cards `#ffffff` |\n| Text | `#212121` primary · `#757575` secondary |\n| Elevation | soft card shadows `0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.26)` |\n| Type | \"Segoe UI\"/Roboto stack, 500-weight buttons in CAPS |\n\n## Pieces\n\nApp bar with **hamburger drawer** (slide-in + scrim) → flat hero with a pure-CSS phone\nmockup → 3 cards with **ripple-effect** buttons → floating action button that fires a\n**snackbar** toast — the full Material interaction set, zero dependencies.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Flatline — Material Era\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fafafa; color: #212121; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n\n  /* app bar */\n  .appbar { background: #2196F3; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 14px; height: 58px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; }\n  .iconbtn { width: 42px; height: 42px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #fff; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .iconbtn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }\n  .appbar .title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; flex: 1; }\n\n  /* drawer */\n  .scrim { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.25s; z-index: 40; }\n  .drawer { position: fixed; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 264px; background: #fff; z-index: 41; transform: translateX(-105%); transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  body.drawer-open .scrim { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }\n  body.drawer-open .drawer { transform: none; }\n  .drawer .head { background: #1976D2; color: #fff; padding: 22px 18px; }\n  .drawer .head .ava { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF4081; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .drawer .head b { font-size: 15px; }\n  .drawer .head small { display: block; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 12px; }\n  .drawer nav { padding: 8px 0; overflow: auto; }\n  .drawer nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 13px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #212121; font-size: 14px; }\n  .drawer nav a:hover { background: #f0f0f0; }\n  .drawer nav a.active { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976D2; font-weight: 600; }\n  .drawer nav .ic { width: 22px; text-align: center; }\n\n  /* ripple */\n  .rip { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .rip .circle { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.25; transform: scale(0); animation: rip 0.55s ease-out forwards; pointer-events: none; }\n  @keyframes rip { to { transform: scale(2.6); opacity: 0; } }\n\n  /* hero */\n  .hero { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px 70px; display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }\n  .hero-copy { flex: 1; }\n  .kicker { color: #2196F3; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.15; margin: 10px 0 16px; }\n  h1 b { font-weight: 700; color: #1976D2; }\n  .hero p { color: #757575; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 26px; max-width: 440px; }\n  .btnrow { display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n  .raised { background: #2196F3; color: #fff; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); }\n  .raised:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .flatbtn { background: none; border: 0; color: #2196F3; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 11px 16px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; }\n\n  /* CSS phone mockup */\n  .phone { flex: none; width: 230px; height: 420px; border-radius: 26px; background: #212121; padding: 40px 12px 30px; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); position: relative; }\n  .phone::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 50%; width: 56px; height: 6px; margin-left: -28px; border-radius: 3px; background: #333; }\n  .screen { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .s-bar { height: 52px; background: #2196F3; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }\n  .s-hero { height: 96px; background: #FF4081; }\n  .s-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px; }\n  .s-chip { flex: 1; height: 52px; border-radius: 3px; background: #e0e0e0; }\n  .s-line { height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; background: #e0e0e0; margin: 0 12px 8px; }\n  .s-line.short { width: 55%; }\n  .fab { position: absolute; right: 12px; bottom: -18px; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF4081; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }\n\n  /* cards */\n  .cards-sec { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px 70px; }\n  .cards-sec h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .cards-sec .sub2 { color: #757575; font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }\n  .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); overflow: hidden; transition: box-shadow 0.25s; }\n  .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); }\n  .card .cover { height: 110px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 42px; color: #fff; }\n  .c-blue { background: #2196F3; } .c-orange { background: #FF9800; } .c-teal { background: #009688; }\n  .card .body { padding: 16px 18px 6px; }\n  .card h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .card p { color: #757575; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .card .act { display: flex; padding: 10px 8px 8px; }\n  .card .act button { flex: 1; }\n\n  /* snackbar */\n  .snackbar { position: fixed; left: 18px; bottom: 18px; background: #323232; color: #fff; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; transform: translateY(150%); transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); z-index: 60; }\n  .snackbar.show { transform: none; }\n  .snackbar button { background: none; border: 0; color: #FF4081; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  .foot { background: #1976D2; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); text-align: center; font-size: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-top: 30px; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 800px) { .hero { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } .hero p { margin-inline: auto; } .btnrow { justify-content: center; } .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"appbar\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" id=\"hamb\" aria-label=\"Menu\">☰\u003c/button>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"title\">Flatline\u003c/div>\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" aria-label=\"Search\">🔍\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" aria-label=\"More\">⋮\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\">\u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ava\">👩‍💻\u003c/div>\n      \u003cb>designer@flatline.io\u003c/b>\n      \u003csmall>Material plan · since 2014\u003c/small>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003ca class=\"active rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">🏠\u003c/span> Home\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">📥\u003c/span> Inbox \u003cspan style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#757575\">3\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">🗂️\u003c/span> Projects\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">⚙️\u003c/span> Settings\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">❓\u003c/span> Help & feedback\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/nav>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hero\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"hero-copy\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"kicker\">Flat design · est. 2013\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>Remove the gloss.\u003cbr>\u003cb>Keep the function.\u003c/b>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>When the bevels and gradients died, interface design grew up. Flat colors, honest shadows and motion with meaning — this page is the whole era in one file.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"btnrow\">\n        \u003cbutton class=\"raised rip\">Get started\u003c/button>\n        \u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\" id=\"learnBtn\">Learn more\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"phone\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"screen\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-bar\">Flatline\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-hero\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-row\">\u003cdiv class=\"s-chip\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s-chip\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line short\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line short\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"fab rip\" id=\"fab\">+\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"cards-sec\">\n    \u003ch2>What's inside\u003c/h2>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"sub2\">Three cards. Every button ripples. Try them.\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cards\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-blue\">📐\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Grid & keylines\u003c/h3>\u003cp>An 8dp spacing grid, 16dp gutters and content that snaps to keylines. Order without ornament.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-orange\">⚡\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Meaningful motion\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Ripples answer every touch, drawers slide with real easing curves, snackbars appear and leave politely.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-teal\">🎨\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Honest color\u003c/h3>\u003cp>One primary, one accent, greys for text. No gradient ever had to carry this much meaning before.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"foot\">Flatline — a tribute to the flat design era (2013–2018) · Built with zero dependencies\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"snackbar\" id=\"snack\">\u003cspan id=\"snackMsg\">Nothing to compose — it's just a demo 🙂\u003c/span>\u003cbutton id=\"snackOk\">OK\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // drawer\n    const open = () => document.body.classList.add('drawer-open');\n    const close = () => document.body.classList.remove('drawer-open');\n    document.getElementById('hamb').addEventListener('click', open);\n    document.getElementById('scrim').addEventListener('click', close);\n    addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape') close(); });\n\n    // material ripple on every .rip element\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rip').forEach(el => {\n      el.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n        const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n        const d = Math.max(r.width, r.height) * 1.2;\n        const s = document.createElement('span');\n        s.className = 'circle';\n        s.style.width = s.style.height = d + 'px';\n        s.style.left = (e.clientX - r.left - d / 2) + 'px';\n        s.style.top = (e.clientY - r.top - d / 2) + 'px';\n        el.appendChild(s);\n        setTimeout(() => s.remove(), 600);\n      });\n    });\n\n    // snackbar\n    const snack = document.getElementById('snack');\n    const msg = document.getElementById('snackMsg');\n    let snackTimer;\n    function showSnack(text) {\n      msg.textContent = text;\n      snack.classList.add('show');\n      clearTimeout(snackTimer);\n      snackTimer = setTimeout(() => snack.classList.remove('show'), 2600);\n    }\n    document.getElementById('fab').addEventListener('click', () => showSnack(\"Nothing to compose — it's just a demo 🙂\"));\n    document.getElementById('snackOk').addEventListener('click', () => snack.classList.remove('show'));\n    document.getElementById('learnBtn').addEventListener('click', () => showSnack('This IS the lesson — you are inside it.'));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Flatline — Material Era\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fafafa; color: #212121; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n\n  /* app bar */\n  .appbar { background: #2196F3; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 14px; height: 58px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; }\n  .iconbtn { width: 42px; height: 42px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #fff; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .iconbtn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }\n  .appbar .title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; flex: 1; }\n\n  /* drawer */\n  .scrim { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.25s; z-index: 40; }\n  .drawer { position: fixed; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 264px; background: #fff; z-index: 41; transform: translateX(-105%); transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  body.drawer-open .scrim { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }\n  body.drawer-open .drawer { transform: none; }\n  .drawer .head { background: #1976D2; color: #fff; padding: 22px 18px; }\n  .drawer .head .ava { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF4081; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .drawer .head b { font-size: 15px; }\n  .drawer .head small { display: block; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 12px; }\n  .drawer nav { padding: 8px 0; overflow: auto; }\n  .drawer nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 13px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #212121; font-size: 14px; }\n  .drawer nav a:hover { background: #f0f0f0; }\n  .drawer nav a.active { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976D2; font-weight: 600; }\n  .drawer nav .ic { width: 22px; text-align: center; }\n\n  /* ripple */\n  .rip { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .rip .circle { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.25; transform: scale(0); animation: rip 0.55s ease-out forwards; pointer-events: none; }\n  @keyframes rip { to { transform: scale(2.6); opacity: 0; } }\n\n  /* hero */\n  .hero { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px 70px; display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }\n  .hero-copy { flex: 1; }\n  .kicker { color: #2196F3; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.15; margin: 10px 0 16px; }\n  h1 b { font-weight: 700; color: #1976D2; }\n  .hero p { color: #757575; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 26px; max-width: 440px; }\n  .btnrow { display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n  .raised { background: #2196F3; color: #fff; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); }\n  .raised:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .flatbtn { background: none; border: 0; color: #2196F3; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 11px 16px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; }\n\n  /* CSS phone mockup */\n  .phone { flex: none; width: 230px; height: 420px; border-radius: 26px; background: #212121; padding: 40px 12px 30px; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); position: relative; }\n  .phone::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 50%; width: 56px; height: 6px; margin-left: -28px; border-radius: 3px; background: #333; }\n  .screen { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .s-bar { height: 52px; background: #2196F3; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }\n  .s-hero { height: 96px; background: #FF4081; }\n  .s-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px; }\n  .s-chip { flex: 1; height: 52px; border-radius: 3px; background: #e0e0e0; }\n  .s-line { height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; background: #e0e0e0; margin: 0 12px 8px; }\n  .s-line.short { width: 55%; }\n  .fab { position: absolute; right: 12px; bottom: -18px; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF4081; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }\n\n  /* cards */\n  .cards-sec { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px 70px; }\n  .cards-sec h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .cards-sec .sub2 { color: #757575; font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }\n  .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); overflow: hidden; transition: box-shadow 0.25s; }\n  .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26); }\n  .card .cover { height: 110px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 42px; color: #fff; }\n  .c-blue { background: #2196F3; } .c-orange { background: #FF9800; } .c-teal { background: #009688; }\n  .card .body { padding: 16px 18px 6px; }\n  .card h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .card p { color: #757575; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .card .act { display: flex; padding: 10px 8px 8px; }\n  .card .act button { flex: 1; }\n\n  /* snackbar */\n  .snackbar { position: fixed; left: 18px; bottom: 18px; background: #323232; color: #fff; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; transform: translateY(150%); transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); z-index: 60; }\n  .snackbar.show { transform: none; }\n  .snackbar button { background: none; border: 0; color: #FF4081; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  .foot { background: #1976D2; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); text-align: center; font-size: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-top: 30px; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 800px) { .hero { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } .hero p { margin-inline: auto; } .btnrow { justify-content: center; } .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"appbar\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" id=\"hamb\" aria-label=\"Menu\">☰\u003c/button>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"title\">Flatline\u003c/div>\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" aria-label=\"Search\">🔍\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton class=\"iconbtn rip\" aria-label=\"More\">⋮\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\">\u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ava\">👩‍💻\u003c/div>\n      \u003cb>designer@flatline.io\u003c/b>\n      \u003csmall>Material plan · since 2014\u003c/small>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003ca class=\"active rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">🏠\u003c/span> Home\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">📥\u003c/span> Inbox \u003cspan style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#757575\">3\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">🗂️\u003c/span> Projects\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">⚙️\u003c/span> Settings\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"rip\" href=\"#\">\u003cspan class=\"ic\">❓\u003c/span> Help & feedback\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/nav>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hero\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"hero-copy\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"kicker\">Flat design · est. 2013\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>Remove the gloss.\u003cbr>\u003cb>Keep the function.\u003c/b>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>When the bevels and gradients died, interface design grew up. Flat colors, honest shadows and motion with meaning — this page is the whole era in one file.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"btnrow\">\n        \u003cbutton class=\"raised rip\">Get started\u003c/button>\n        \u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\" id=\"learnBtn\">Learn more\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"phone\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"screen\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-bar\">Flatline\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-hero\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-row\">\u003cdiv class=\"s-chip\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s-chip\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line short\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"s-line short\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"fab rip\" id=\"fab\">+\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"cards-sec\">\n    \u003ch2>What's inside\u003c/h2>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"sub2\">Three cards. Every button ripples. Try them.\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cards\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-blue\">📐\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Grid & keylines\u003c/h3>\u003cp>An 8dp spacing grid, 16dp gutters and content that snaps to keylines. Order without ornament.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-orange\">⚡\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Meaningful motion\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Ripples answer every touch, drawers slide with real easing curves, snackbars appear and leave politely.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cover c-teal\">🎨\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"body\">\u003ch3>Honest color\u003c/h3>\u003cp>One primary, one accent, greys for text. No gradient ever had to carry this much meaning before.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cbutton class=\"flatbtn rip\">Read more\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"foot\">Flatline — a tribute to the flat design era (2013–2018) · Built with zero dependencies\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"snackbar\" id=\"snack\">\u003cspan id=\"snackMsg\">Nothing to compose — it's just a demo 🙂\u003c/span>\u003cbutton id=\"snackOk\">OK\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // drawer\n    const open = () => document.body.classList.add('drawer-open');\n    const close = () => document.body.classList.remove('drawer-open');\n    document.getElementById('hamb').addEventListener('click', open);\n    document.getElementById('scrim').addEventListener('click', close);\n    addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape') close(); });\n\n    // material ripple on every .rip element\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rip').forEach(el => {\n      el.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n        const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n        const d = Math.max(r.width, r.height) * 1.2;\n        const s = document.createElement('span');\n        s.className = 'circle';\n        s.style.width = s.style.height = d + 'px';\n        s.style.left = (e.clientX - r.left - d / 2) + 'px';\n        s.style.top = (e.clientY - r.top - d / 2) + 'px';\n        el.appendChild(s);\n        setTimeout(() => s.remove(), 600);\n      });\n    });\n\n    // snackbar\n    const snack = document.getElementById('snack');\n    const msg = document.getElementById('snackMsg');\n    let snackTimer;\n    function showSnack(text) {\n      msg.textContent = text;\n      snack.classList.add('show');\n      clearTimeout(snackTimer);\n      snackTimer = setTimeout(() => snack.classList.remove('show'), 2600);\n    }\n    document.getElementById('fab').addEventListener('click', () => showSnack(\"Nothing to compose — it's just a demo 🙂\"));\n    document.getElementById('snackOk').addEventListener('click', () => snack.classList.remove('show'));\n    document.getElementById('learnBtn').addEventListener('click', () => showSnack('This IS the lesson — you are inside it.'));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}